/-!
# The low-resolution ball chain of the guiding-centre torus (`v∥ < 0`)

The balls `‖X i − x i‖_r ≤ E i` of all variables of the low-resolution pipeline, on every strip
`r ≥ 0` with `e^r ≤ 74315/2^16`
and every torus `(u, z)` within the input radii of the low-resolution torus,
built variable by variable (`ballL_k`, `chain_succ`) from the kernel checks of
`Design/RationalStellaratorGCNegTorusCheckL*` (`node_full`), the node identities of
`Design/RationalStellaratorGCNegTorusRelL` and the node step `vstep`. Generated by
`scripts/gc_kam/neg_emit_lean.py`.
-/

@[expose] public section
noncomputable section

namespace PlasmaLean.Design.RationalStellaratorGCNeg

open PlasmaLean.Design.RationalStellaratorGC
open PlasmaLean.Theory.KAM PlasmaLean.Design.KamNewton PlasmaLean.Certificates.KronExpr
  PlasmaLean.Certificates.KronBall PlasmaLean.Certificates.Kron2 WEll1Z2 Complex

/-- The centre of `cos 2φ`. -/
theorem xL_c : xL 2 = cS := ctr_cPoly SL NL ML

/-- The centre of `sin 2φ`. -/
theorem xL_s : xL 3 = sS := ctr_sPoly SL NL ML

